OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAQueues build outside British
OL,4,AMuseum as Bayeux Tapestry exhibit to
OL,5,Aopen to public for first time
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Bayeux Tapestry was originally
OL,8,Fembroidered in England but kept for
OL,9,Fcenturies in France, and tells the
OL,10,Fstory of the Norman conquest of England
OL,11,Fand the Battle of Hastings in 1066
OL,13,FThis is a loan almost 100 years in the
OL,14,Fmaking, but there has been some vocal
OL,15,Fopposition in France
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
